    "enum_pre_comment": [
      "Elevator / lever-lift: a disk MSB ObjAct EVENT whose objActParamId is a \"lever\" ObjActParam",
      "(its live ActionButtonParam prompt text is \"Pull lever\"/\"Push lever\"). Runtime disk-MSB parse,",
      "no bake. See docs/re/linux_group2_prompt_binding_re_findings.md."
    ]
  },
  {
    "enum": "WorldSmithingTable",
    "name": "World - Smithing Tables",
    "section": "Services",
    "enum_pre_comment": [
      "Smithing Table: a disk MSB Asset with model AEG099_308 (3 world placements). Plain model filter",
      "over the disk asset enumeration, no bake. See docs/re/linux_group2_prompt_binding_re_findings.md."
    ]
  },
  {
    "enum": "WorldFarmableCollectible",
    "name": "Loot - Farmable Drops",
    "section": "Loot",
    "enum_pre_comment": [
      "MFG-original: enemy drops that RESPAWN (ItemLotParam getItemFlagId==0 / repeatable) AND are a",
      "notable farm target (Smithing Stones / Golden Runes / Gloveworts). Surfaces the farmable enemy",
      "drops the notable-loot pass currently skips. Live, no bake. (WorldFarmableEnemy was dropped —",
      "marking every respawning mob floods the map with no clean boss filter.)"
    ]
  },
  {
    "enum": "WorldMerchant",
    "name": "World - Merchants",
    "section": "Services",
    "enum_pre_comment": [
      "Merchant / shop NPC: a disk MSB Enemy whose TalkID runs OpenRegularShop (talk command 1:22)",
      "in the active install's talk ESDs (runtime C++ ESD parse, load_merchant_shop_ranges). Name =",
      "live NpcParam.nameId -> NpcName. Mod-agnostic, no bake. See",
      "docs/plans/merchant_item_search_plan.md Slice 3 option A.",
      "Glyph = engine map-point iconId 80, the SAME symbol as WorldQuestNPC, so a merchant",
      "who also has a hand-authored quest STEP pin overlaps invisibly (one visual marker)."
    ],
    "glyph": {
      "icon_id": 80,
      "scale": 1.0
    }
  },
  {
    "enum": "Uncategorised",
    "name": "Loot - Other",
    "section": "Loot",
    "enum_pre_comment": [
      "TERMINAL catch-all — MUST stay LAST (every 'Category::…) + 1' count idiom points here).",
      "Any pickup MFG's live taxonomy can't classify (cat < 0) is routed here instead of being",
      "draw-skipped, so no marker silently vanishes — critical for mod-agnostic support (a non-ERR",
      "mod's items may not match any ER taxonomy cell). No glyph: it resolves the loot's OWN native",
      "item icon (TIER_ITEM, per-marker item_icon_id), falling to a plain circle only on a real miss."
    ]
  }
]
